<section class="page-head">
    <div class="container">
        <h1 class="page-head__title">Download</h1>
        <p class="page-head__lead">
The rootfs is the base system archive. It contains a minimal system, with no installer and no desktop environment.
        </p>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="release-section">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="release">
            <div class="release__status" data-release-loading></div>
            <div class="release__status release__status--error" data-release-error hidden></div>

            <div class="release__content" data-release-content hidden>
                <div class="release__info">
                    <span class="release__eyebrow">Latest release</span>
                    <p class="release__date" data-release-date></p>
                    <p class="release__file" data-release-file></p>
                </div>

                <div class="release__actions">
                    <a href="#" class="btn btn--primary btn--lg" data-release-archive target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"></a>
                    <a href="#" class="btn btn--ghost btn--lg" data-release-checksum target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"></a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="section-head">
            <h2 class="section-title">Verify the archive</h2>
            <p class="section-text">
Check each archive against its BLAKE3 checksum before unpacking. A failed check means the file is damaged or changed.
            </p>
        </div>

        <ol class="procedure">
            <li class="procedure__item">
                <span class="procedure__number">1</span>
                <div class="procedure__body">
                    <h3 class="procedure__title">Download both files</h3>
                    <p class="procedure__text">Keep the archive and its <code>.b3sum</code> file in the same directory.</p>
                </div>
            </li>

            <li class="procedure__item">
                <span class="procedure__number">2</span>
                <div class="procedure__body">
                    <h3 class="procedure__title">Run the check</h3>
                    <p class="procedure__text">Run this in that directory. OK next to the archive name means the check passed.</p>
                    <pre class="code"><code>b3sum -c vylen-rootfs-x86_64_&lt;date&gt;.tar.xz.b3sum</code></pre>
                </div>
            </li>
        </ol>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="section-head">
            <h2 class="section-title">Unpack the archive</h2>
            <p class="section-text">
Extract as root into an empty directory. The <code>-p</code> option keeps the permissions stored in the archive.
            </p>
        </div>

        <pre class="code"><code>tar xvJpf vylen-rootfs-x86_64_&lt;date&gt;.tar.xz -C /mnt/vylen</code></pre>
    </div>
</section>
